{#- "Track this car" card at the end of a vehicle page. Expects vehicle + vehicleKey. -#}
<section class="garage-cta" id="track-your-car" aria-labelledby="garage-cta-title">
    <div class="garage-cta-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">Own a {{ vehicle.model }}?</p>
        <h2 id="garage-cta-title">Track it in My Garage</h2>
        <p>Add your car and you get a {{ vehicle.model }} service schedule with intervals already filled in, a restoration tracker organized by system, and a log of every job and what it cost. It's free, and it's the same on your phone and your laptop.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="garage-cta-actions">
        <a href="/account/garage/?add={{ vehicleKey }}" class="btn btn-primary">Add my {{ vehicle.model }}</a>
        <a href="/tools/" class="btn btn-secondary">See all tools</a>
    </div>
</section>
